## 11. 终交付前最后一遍

按顺序：

- [ ] `python tools/number_audit.py` → N/N PASS
- [ ] `python tools/humanize_check.py` → 7/7 OK
- [ ] `python tools/punct_audit.py` → 7/7 PASS
- [ ] `pwsh tools/compile.ps1` → out/paper.pdf 写出，警告 ≤ 1
- [ ] `python tools/pdf_reverse_verify.py` → 字符级 + 数字真值 + chinese-docx-humanize 三阶段全 PASS
- [ ] 抽 3-5 对中文引号样本肉眼复核字形
- [ ] 致谢段逐句问"实际有谁做过这件事"
- [ ] `grep -n "TODO_ref" src/references.bib` → 0 命中
- [ ] PDF 页码、目录、交叉引用收敛（最后两次 xelatex 输出无 "Rerun to get cross-references right"）

全过 → 交付。任一项 FAIL → 修源 + 重编 + 重推，不修报告。
